Chapter: TupleBasic
  cites Foreword chapter Tuple
  cites Codex chapter General

 Build tuples with `(x, y)` and take them apart with a tuple pattern.

Section: Definitions

  swap : Tup2 a b -> Tup2 b a
  swap (p) = when p
    is (x, y) -> (y, x)

  sum3 : Tup3 Integer Integer Integer -> Integer
  sum3 (t) = when t
    is (a, b, c) -> a + b + c

  compute : Integer
  compute = when swap (10, 20)
    is (x, y) -> sum3 (x, y, 99)

  opening : [Console] Nothing = act
    print-line-uni (show compute)
  end

